WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.632 --> 00:00:18.636
"Aah!" shouted Roxy.

2
00:00:18.656 --> 00:00:20.597
"I'm trapped in a bubble!"

3
00:00:22.097 --> 00:00:23.818
The bubble drifted high in the sky.

4
00:00:26.098 --> 00:00:28.879
Looking down, Roxy could see the robot stomping on a bus.

5
00:00:30.099 --> 00:00:32.300
The robot was on its way to Metro City Bank!

6
00:00:35.276 --> 00:00:35.496
"Oh no!"

7
00:00:35.516 --> 00:00:36.077
thought Roxy.

8
00:00:37.057 --> 00:00:40.500
"I have to stop that robot before it steals Metro City Bank!"

9
00:00:41.961 --> 00:00:43.982
She hit the bubble's wall as hard as she could.

10
00:00:46.123 --> 00:00:47.905
Boing! Boing!

11
00:00:48.305 --> 00:00:52.207
Boing! Roxy bounced around inside the bubble for a few moments.

12
00:00:53.728 --> 00:00:54.709
She hit the bubble again.

13
00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:56.771
Boing! Boing!

14
00:00:57.211 --> 00:01:02.294
Boing! Whiz-hoo!

15
00:01:02.955 --> 00:01:04.536
Roxy shot lasers from her eyes.

16
00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:07.001
Boing! Boing!

17
00:01:07.421 --> 00:01:09.903
Boing! "Aah!"

18
00:01:10.283 --> 00:01:11.764
shouted Roxy in frustration.

19
00:01:12.845 --> 00:01:15.367
She ducked and jumped as the laser bounced around the bubble.

20
00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:18.489
"Whew!" cried Roxy.

21
00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:20.730
"That was a terrible idea.

22
00:01:21.711 --> 00:01:23.232
Maybe my heat vision will work."

23
00:01:25.433 --> 00:01:27.635
An orange beam radiated from Roxy's eyes.

24
00:01:28.615 --> 00:01:29.676
The beam didn't bounce.

25
00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:32.478
But now the bubble was filled with smoke!

26
00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:35.080
Roxy stopped her heat vision.

27
00:01:36.532 --> 00:01:38.434
She looked at the spot she had tried to burn.

28
00:01:39.355 --> 00:01:40.656
There was no damage at all.

29
00:01:41.617 --> 00:01:43.598
By now she was far above Metro City.

30
00:01:44.579 --> 00:01:46.941
She saw the robot standing in front of Metro City Bank.

31
00:01:48.202 --> 00:01:50.384
Without thinking, Roxy shot toward the robot.

32
00:01:51.145 --> 00:01:52.086
And the bubble went with her.

33
00:01:52.106 --> 00:01:53.827
"This is perfect!"

34
00:01:54.127 --> 00:01:54.808
thought Roxy.

35
00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:57.150
She flew in front of the robot.

36
00:01:58.391 --> 00:02:00.653
Using her x-ray vision, she looked into the robot.

37
00:02:02.274 --> 00:02:03.996
A small man sat inside its head.

38
00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:07.021
The man had a bald head and dark goggles.

39
00:02:07.981 --> 00:02:09.222
He wore a blue space suit.

40
00:02:10.963 --> 00:02:11.703
"Dr. Odd!"

41
00:02:12.023 --> 00:02:12.724
Roxy shouted.

42
00:02:12.744 --> 00:02:15.365
"You're not going to get away with this!"

43
00:02:16.245 --> 00:02:18.126
The evil villain was surprised to hear her.

44
00:02:18.146 --> 00:02:20.067
"Rocket Girl?

45
00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:25.389
Aargh!" Roxy bounced her bubble into the robot's face.

46
00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:30.411
Boing! "You can't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

47
00:02:30.731 --> 00:02:31.632
Dr. Odd yelled.

48
00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.441
"Not if you're trapped in that bubble!

49
00:02:34.761 --> 00:02:37.182
Ha-ha!" Dr.

50
00:02:37.262 --> 00:02:38.002
Odd pulled a lever.

51
00:02:39.143 --> 00:02:40.584
The robot knocked the bubble away.

52
00:02:41.784 --> 00:02:43.205
It raised its arm toward the bank.

53
00:02:44.185 --> 00:02:46.246
Roxy bounced the bubble off the robot again.

54
00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:50.508
Boing! "I won't let you steal that bank!"

55
00:02:50.788 --> 00:02:51.468
Roxy yelled.

56
00:02:52.569 --> 00:02:55.450
The robot waved its arm, knocking Roxy's bubble away again.

57
00:02:57.231 --> 00:02:59.432
Roxy kept moving her bubble in front of the robot.

58
00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:02.720
She could see Dr.

59
00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:03.541
Odd getting angry.

60
00:03:03.561 --> 00:03:06.701
"Get out of my way!"

61
00:03:07.102 --> 00:03:07.702
shouted Dr.

62
00:03:07.842 --> 00:03:09.522
Odd. "No!"

63
00:03:09.862 --> 00:03:10.603
Roxy shouted.

64
00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:13.303
"Aargh!" cried Dr.

65
00:03:13.443 --> 00:03:17.705
Odd. "I'll never steal the bank with this bubble in my way!"

66
00:03:19.085 --> 00:03:20.265
Dr. Odd pressed a button.

67
00:03:22.366 --> 00:03:23.946
The robot poked Roxy's bubble.

68
00:03:24.586 --> 00:03:28.528
Pop! "Now I'll finish you!"

69
00:03:28.868 --> 00:03:29.448
yelled Dr.

70
00:03:29.588 --> 00:03:33.165
Odd. The robot moved toward
